[{"id":165131600,"discussion_id":"41157b00dcef48500c6e3ea361a4b073c5c12c59","body":"Thanks for your pull-request.\nThe full list of commands accepted by me can be found at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/robot/robot%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97.md#-%E5%A6%82%E9%9C%80%E4%BA%86%E8%A7%A3%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E7%9A%84%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E5%8F%AF%E5%8F%82%E8%80%83%E4%B8%8B%E6%96%B9%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E8%A1%A8%E6%A0%BC)。\nYou can get sig-info at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/community/blob/master/CANN/sigs/ops-transformer/sig-info.yaml)\n\n\n---\n\n## PR Approval Progress\n\n✅ **Congratulations! All modules have met the lgtm and approve requirements.**\n\n### Module Approval Details\n\n| module | lgtm status | approve status |\n|------|-----------|--------------|\n| attention | ✅ [*monologue815*](https://gitcode.com/monologue815), [*cc-z*](https://gitcode.com/cc-z) (2/2) | ✅ [*monologue815*](https://gitcode.com/monologue815), [*cc-z*](https://gitcode.com/cc-z) (2/1) |\n\n> \uD83D\uDCA1 Tip:\n> - **Committer** can comment `/approve` or `/lgtm`\n> - Commenting `/approve` implies both code review (lgtm) and intent to merge (approve)\n\n------\n\n## CLA Signature Pass  \n clee11, thanks for your pull request. All authors of the commits have signed the CLA. :+1:","created_at":"2026-03-13T09:01:53+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-13T11:39:09+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":165131612,"discussion_id":"bac33ecb05f1a901c169dfbe8855b29a182571b4","body":":large_blue_circle: source code change are detected, tasks labels is removed in this pull request!","created_at":"2026-03-13T09:02:03+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-13T09:02:03+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":165131629,"discussion_id":"2ceff2f4517b9585bf625c3885a8782a3bff271c","body":"## 问题/功能描述\n\n本次PR旨在修复在线Softmax低精度计算内核中因UB（Unified Buffer）数据使用不当而可能导致的计算正确性问题。原始实现中，中间计算步骤与输入数据共享同一缓冲区，存在数据被覆盖的风险。通过重构，将计算过程与数据存储分离，并优化了事件同步逻辑，从而提升了计算流水线的稳定性和代码可读性。\n\n## 修改方案描述\n\n核心修改是引入并使用独立的计算缓冲区`computeUbTensor`。具体包括：1) 将Scale、Sub、Exp等中间计算的源/目标张量从`lsUbTensor`迁移至`computeUbTensor`，避免覆盖原始输入数据；2) 将Rowmax、Rowsum等归约操作的输入源也改为`computeUbTensor`，确保基于正确的中间结果进行计算；3) 将硬编码的事件ID替换为明确常量，使同步逻辑更清晰；4) 简化了`CopySGmToUb`函数的参数传递。这些改动共同确保了计算逻辑的正确性和健壮性。","created_at":"2026-03-13T09:02:20+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-13T09:02:20+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":165132369,"discussion_id":"3e6ef4659f4714221b5644dbdd57359810cd5f71","body":"/compile","created_at":"2026-03-13T09:09:17+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-13T09:09:17+08:00","user":{"id":"68abd6710f820658f05c263a","login":"clee11","object_id":"68abd6710f820658f05c263a","name":"clee11","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/clee11"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":165132480,"discussion_id":"9a72252f073011947a66a3eefe4e4dee58b67017","body":"流水线任务触发成功\n任务链接 [<b><a href='https://www.openlibing.com/apps/pipelineDetail?pipelineId=0d4f52bd3a494432a028df25bc3297f8&pipelineRunId=690aa7fe49ef4e2399ed31f290f5b0f8&projectName=CANN'>690aa7fe49ef4e2399ed31f290f5b0f8</a></b>][<b><a href='https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/ci/ci_g